Author Scott Barker <scott@mostlylinux.ca>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/465109
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2009 15:05:12 -0600
Subject: Add ability to change application icon
 I needed the ability to change the icon for applications (I use xfce,
 which provides no native way of doing this), so I modified wmctrl to
 include this capability.

